    <https://doi.org/10.1177/10597123241269740> dct:date "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dct:title "Classical sorting algorithms as a model of morphogenesis: Self-sorting arrays reveal unexpected competencies in a minimal model of basal intelligence" .
